### 健康检查
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### 全部联系人
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contacts

### 按关键词搜索（姓名、公司、职位、分组、任意联系方式）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contacts?q=13800138000

### 只看收藏
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contacts?bookmarked=true

### 按分组过滤
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contacts?group=同学

### 统计信息（总数、收藏数、分组计数）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contacts/summary

### 新建联系人（一个联系人多条联系方式）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "苏晴",
  "group": "同学",
  "company": "福州大学",
  "title": "计算机学院 本科生",
  "notes": "同班同学",
  "bookmarked": false,
  "methods": [
    { "type": "PHONE", "label": "手机", "value": "13800138001" },
    { "type": "PHONE", "label": "宿舍", "value": "0591-22861234" },
    { "type": "EMAIL", "label": "邮箱", "value": "suqing@example.com" },
    { "type": "SOCIAL", "label": "微信", "value": "suqing_fzu" },
    { "type": "ADDRESS", "label": "宿舍地址", "value": "福州市闽侯县学园路 2 号" }
  ]
}

### 更新联系人
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/contacts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "苏晴",
  "group": "同学",
  "company": "福州大学",
  "title": "计算机学院 本科生",
  "notes": "同班同学，算法课队友",
  "bookmarked": true,
  "methods": [
    { "type": "PHONE", "label": "手机", "value": "13800138001" },
    { "type": "EMAIL", "label": "邮箱", "value": "suqing@example.com" }
  ]
}

### 收藏 / 取消收藏
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/contacts/1/bookmark
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookmarked": true }

### 删除联系人
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/contacts/1

### 导出 Excel
GET http://localhost:8080/api/excel/export

### 下载导入模板
GET http://localhost:8080/api/excel/template

### 导入 Excel（multipart，字段名 file）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/excel/import
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary

--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="demo-contacts.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./docs/demo-contacts.xlsx
--Boundary--

### 参数校验失败示例（姓名为空）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "  " }
